## This is the makefile for :System.Tools:AppleTalk:QuickLogoff.## It is a system.setup that can be used with network booting.# If installed, when the user's startup application quits, the# user will be logged off and then logon will run.  This bypasses# the menu which also allows you to re-run the startup application# or to reboot.## Written by Mark Day#QL				=	{NetBoot}QuickLogoff:{SDAppleTalk}QuickLogoff	Ä	{QL}quick.o	LinkIIGS -o {SDAppleTalk}QuickLogoff -t $B7 {QL}quick.o{QL}quick.o			Ä	{QL}quick.aii	AsmIIGS -o {QL}quick.o {QL}quick.aii